This file marks the multi-chapter development line (branch `multi-chapter`).

It must NEVER exist on `main`. The pre-push hook (scripts/pre-push.sh) and
.github/workflows/protect-main.yml both refuse main commits that contain it.

Delete it only in the final, deliberate `multi-chapter -> main` release PR
(together with the `multi-chapter-release` label).
See docs/MULTI_CHAPTER_BRANCHING.md.
